{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "The Awakening of the Bleak Dimension",
    "steam_appid": 3590510,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590510/extras/46d61a55e9c0badd8d9fab1e9e0166cf.webp?t=1745580300\" width=500 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel through six distinct areas, each with its own unique biome and enemies, in a journey filled with dangers and rewards. To progress, you\u2019ll need to strengthen your character in two ways:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leveling up by defeating enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forging powerful equipment by finding blueprints hidden in chests.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each new area is more challenging than the last, requiring strategy and preparation to face the terrors of the Bleak Dimension.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590510/extras/9359eef49dbfb7a12f344f93450f0859.poster.avif?t=1745580300\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590510/extras/9359eef49dbfb7a12f344f93450f0859.webm?t=1745580300\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590510/extras/9359eef49dbfb7a12f344f93450f0859.mp4?t=1745580300\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590510/extras/3fa9b1b87d2afa616b7ea95fd86dd318.webp?t=1745580300\" width=500 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Camp serves as the game's central HUB, where you\u2019ll find NPCs offering essential services for your journey. Here, you can:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade equipment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enhance your healing Elixir.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swap characters as needed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590510/extras/8ec12e3e2bd55778a6c903bd14ceb0c9.avif?t=1745580300\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590510/extras/464f760e2ea13edaed973e8933a1e64f.webp?t=1745580300\" width=500 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from three distinct combat styles:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Melee</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ranged</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Magic</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features nine characters, three from each class. Initially, only three are available, while the others can be unlocked by meeting certain conditions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590510/extras/855c0dec8fe32052d9a041940bf5bde5.avif?t=1745580300\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590510/extras/f3ed2aa5e8dc212af769aad7f5470f7f.webp?t=1745580300\" width=500 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture out to find rare blueprints hidden in chests and bring them to the blacksmith at the Camp to craft new gear. Loot prioritizes items for your current class, ensuring continuous and efficient progression. Available equipment includes:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swords</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Staves</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bows</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shields</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Armor</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accessories</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you collect all blueprints from an area, chests will start offering gear for other classes, encouraging exploration of new regions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590510/extras/f20988371bcd0a9ad9a4f2c78674be5f.avif?t=1745580300\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590510/extras/eb4df42a634f91442ea416be5cbedfb6.webp?t=1745580300\" width=500 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Elixir is your main healing resource and can be enhanced with crystals collected throughout your journey. Use the Alchemy Table at the Camp to increase both healing potency and maximum charges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590510/extras/aabd497c27d9479421ba6e2e4ed32fcb.avif?t=1745580300\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590510/extras/8596b6cacb6c161e1c2540c99be1a8c1.webp?t=1745580300\" width=500 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each new piece of equipment forged unlocks a unique skin to customize your character. Weapon skins are earned by crafting specific weapons, while character skins are unlocked by completing armor sets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590510/extras/0214054bfeffb5e23edf89c855bfdece.avif?t=1745580300\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face increasingly brutal challenges, uncover hidden secrets, and become the hero who will seal the Bleak Dimension forever! Are you ready for this journey?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590510/extras/46d61a55e9c0badd8d9fab1e9e0166cf.webp?t=1745580300\" width=500 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel through six distinct areas, each with its own unique biome and enemies, in a journey filled with dangers and rewards. To progress, you\u2019ll need to strengthen your character in two ways:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leveling up by defeating enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forging powerful equipment by finding blueprints hidden in chests.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each new area is more challenging than the last, requiring strategy and preparation to face the terrors of the Bleak Dimension.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590510/extras/9359eef49dbfb7a12f344f93450f0859.poster.avif?t=1745580300\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590510/extras/9359eef49dbfb7a12f344f93450f0859.webm?t=1745580300\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590510/extras/9359eef49dbfb7a12f344f93450f0859.mp4?t=1745580300\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590510/extras/3fa9b1b87d2afa616b7ea95fd86dd318.webp?t=1745580300\" width=500 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Camp serves as the game's central HUB, where you\u2019ll find NPCs offering essential services for your journey. Here, you can:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade equipment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enhance your healing Elixir.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swap characters as needed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590510/extras/8ec12e3e2bd55778a6c903bd14ceb0c9.avif?t=1745580300\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590510/extras/464f760e2ea13edaed973e8933a1e64f.webp?t=1745580300\" width=500 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from three distinct combat styles:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Melee</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ranged</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Magic</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features nine characters, three from each class. Initially, only three are available, while the others can be unlocked by meeting certain conditions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590510/extras/855c0dec8fe32052d9a041940bf5bde5.avif?t=1745580300\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590510/extras/f3ed2aa5e8dc212af769aad7f5470f7f.webp?t=1745580300\" width=500 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture out to find rare blueprints hidden in chests and bring them to the blacksmith at the Camp to craft new gear. Loot prioritizes items for your current class, ensuring continuous and efficient progression. Available equipment includes:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swords</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Staves</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bows</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shields</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Armor</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accessories</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you collect all blueprints from an area, chests will start offering gear for other classes, encouraging exploration of new regions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590510/extras/f20988371bcd0a9ad9a4f2c78674be5f.avif?t=1745580300\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590510/extras/eb4df42a634f91442ea416be5cbedfb6.webp?t=1745580300\" width=500 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Elixir is your main healing resource and can be enhanced with crystals collected throughout your journey. Use the Alchemy Table at the Camp to increase both healing potency and maximum charges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590510/extras/aabd497c27d9479421ba6e2e4ed32fcb.avif?t=1745580300\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590510/extras/8596b6cacb6c161e1c2540c99be1a8c1.webp?t=1745580300\" width=500 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each new piece of equipment forged unlocks a unique skin to customize your character. Weapon skins are earned by crafting specific weapons, while character skins are unlocked by completing armor sets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590510/extras/0214054bfeffb5e23edf89c855bfdece.avif?t=1745580300\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face increasingly brutal challenges, uncover hidden secrets, and become the hero who will seal the Bleak Dimension forever! Are you ready for this journey?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "The portal to the dreaded Bleak Dimension has been opened, unleashing terrifying creatures. Your mission is to seal it before it's too late! In The Awakening of the Bleak Dimension, a fantasy RPG you will face brutal challenges, evolve your character and forge powerful equipment.",
